cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets, scripts, or figures, please cite this repository."
title: "IA-FMR Results: Reproducible Results and Figures for In-Action Fair Max Rate"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Lopes"
    given-names: "Diego Canizio"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-05
abstract: >
  Consolidated experimental results, provenance information, portable analysis
  scripts, and reproducible figures for the evaluation of the In-Action Fair
  Max Rate (IA-FMR) scheduler for 5G NR resource scheduling. The repository
  includes bandwidth evaluation, temporal analysis at 40 MHz, scalability
  evaluation, and XR/QoE results.
keywords:
  - "5G NR"
  - "radio resource scheduling"
  - "reinforcement learning"
  - "PPO"
  - "fairness"
  - "throughput"
  - "XR"
  - "QoE"

repository-code: "https://github.com/DiegoCanizio/ia-fmr-results"
